.SH "نام (NAME)"
create_cvsignore \- Create preliminary \&.cvsignore in the current directory
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBcreatecvsignore\fR\ 'u
\fBcreatecvsignore\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
\fBcreate_cvsignore\fR
is used to create a preliminary
\&.cvsignore
in the current directory\&. It does this based on certain contents it finds in
Makefile\&.am
.PP
No lines will be removed from any existing
\&.cvsignore\&. If there is not already a
\&.cvsignore
file, it will be added to the cvs repository\&.
.PP
Note that you must have a
Makefile\&.am
in the current directory for this tool to work\&.
.PP
This utility is part of the
KDE
Software Development Kit\&.
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.PP
\fBBen Burton\fR <\&bab@debian\&.org\&>
